    "description": "Can be shown anytime - Call/Text Malin 650.219.4725\n\nStunning Mira Glen Remodel. Water Views: 2bd, 2ba, deck, hobby area, laundry room, garage, storage is accented by modern high end finishes and walnut wooden flooring throughout. The living room is framed by a custom Italian tiled gas fireplace with large windows, recessed lighting and juliet balcony.  Separate dining room offers neighborhood views.  Adjacent hobby area including built in desk with oversized chalk board.  Sleek chef kitchen with mini glass tile back splash, large sink and seamlessly positioned Thermador gas range, oven and dishwasher.  Copious counter space and soft close cabinets.  Master bedroom with generous organized walk in closet has access to the deck.  Stylish master bath with custom shower stall Hudson Reed shower system and raised massaging pebble pan, quartz vanity, floor to ceiling strie rectangular tiles.  Second bedroom has a serene outlook.  Ultra modern second bath floor to ceiling linear carrara marble Turkish tiles frameless Hudson Reed Shower system over tub.  An impeccable home!\n\n17-19 Valletta Court is an elevator 2 unit TIC building located in Glen Park.  Handsome entry lobby with video intercom.  First level also features private garages, laundry, and storage.  Top of the line remodeled homes have water views, outdoor spaces, custom lighting, wooden floors throughout.  The building has a new roof, windows and added structural support.  Mira Glen is a tucked away enclave of homes and the neighborhood is known for its well maintained green spaces.  Cul-de-sac street close to everything.  Short Distance to Glen Park BART, Tech Shuttles, 280/101 Freeway, and MUNI J line. #44 Bus stop is at the corner of O'Shaughnessy and Malta. \n\nHome Features: \nFull remodel\nWooden walnut floors\nNew Milgard windows\nGranite counter tops\nImported tiles\nRecessed lighting\nDeck\n\n\nBuilding:\nNew roof\nElevator\nPrivate Garages\nLaundry\n\nEntertainment:\nGlen Park Downtown\nCity Parks\nLe P'tit Laurent"
  },
